{"id":"6be0fd6df8f81383","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-truth-predicate-function.md","title":"具体系统的量词概括与反射功能","display":"prop-truth-predicate-function — 具体系统的量词概括与反射功能","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-truth-predicate-function","aliases":["91-prop-truth-predicate-function","91-prop-truth-predicate-role","91-predicate-utility"],"display":"prop-truth-predicate-function — 具体系统的量词概括与反射功能","depends_on":["[[91-thm-compositional-completeness]]","[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency]]","[[91-df-coded-syntax]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-truth-predicate-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-truth-predicate-function</span><span>91-prop-truth-predicate-role</span><span>91-predicate-utility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-truth-predicate-function — 具体系统的量词概括与反射功能"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"73ccb673e6681e3d\" href=\"?note=73ccb673e6681e3d\" title=\"91-thm-compositional-completeness\">91-thm-compositional-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a295446296ee06c0\" href=\"?note=a295446296ee06c0\" title=\"91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency\">91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span> 为标准版本。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_x\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_x\\)</span> 为数字代入；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 为 PA 的对象全局反射句。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\forall x\\varphi(x)\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\,T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\forall x\\varphi(x)\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\,T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式用基础闭句及统一数字实例去引号：左右分别等价于 ∀n φ(n)。它针对一个固定基础矩阵，不在元层任意量化公式后当作同一对象公式。\n第二式复用具体 KF 证明。原稿把未展开的 QComp 和 TRefl 当作条件、再重述它们的预期内容，不能承担源书定理，现换成有真实公理与证明依赖的两个例子。\nCon(PA) 本来就是算术可写的；T 的用途是概括与反射证明，而非首次使该句可表达。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 8.4、§8.6；KF 在基础语言上的组合归纳推导。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-compositional-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"73ccb673e6681e3d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-compositional-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"a295446296ee06c0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}function}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\forall x\\varphi(x)\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\,T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n)),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA}).","display":true}],"bytes":1671,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-191","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-truth-predicate-function]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-191","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-truth-predicate-function]]"}],"outgoing":["73ccb673e6681e3d","a295446296ee06c0","38c875c58a0bf84c"]}